  "job_B9.7.4_20251003_115119": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00f0\u00e6re so\u00f0en d\u00e6dbote m\u00e6ign se H\u00e6lend sylf on his godspelle \u00e6teowde, \u00feuss cwe\u00f0ende, & Johannes se fulhtere cw\u00e6\u00f0, Do\u00f0 medeme w\u00e6stmes d\u00e6dbote. \u00de\u00e6t is se medeme w\u00e6stme \u00fe\u00e6re d\u00e6dbote, \u00fe\u00e6t man \u00fea geworhte synne bewepe, & \u00fee \u00fea he \u00feonne & drihten cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00feurh Isaiam \u00feone witega, a\u00f0wea\u00f0 eow & by\u00f0 cl\u00e6ne. Se by\u00f0 a\u00f0wegen & by\u00f0 cl\u00e6ne, se \u00fee his \u00fea geworhte synnen bewepe\u00f0, & \u00fea \u00fea he \u00feonne bewepe\u00f0, eft Se eadige apostel Petrus cw\u00e6\u00f0 beo \u00fean mannen, \u00fee heora synnen bewepe\u00f0, & eft \u00e6fter \u00fean wope \u00fea Eac \u00fe\u00e6t halge gewrit cwe\u00f0\u00f0, gyf \u00feu sume synne dest, ne geech \u00feu \u00fea synne mid o\u00f0re synnen, ac \u00feu Seo so\u00f0e d\u00e6dbote ne by\u00f0 na \u00e6fter geara gerime gescrifen, ac beo \u00fe\u00e6s synfulles mannes modes Seo d\u00e6dbote \u00feeh heo beo lytle hwile, gyf heo by\u00f0 mid inneweardre heorta sarignysse gedon, fram Ne sece\u00f0 God na swa swy\u00f0e \u00fea lenge \u00fe\u00e6re tide, swa he sceawe\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re lufe smyltnysse \u00fe\u00e6s So\u00f0lice se \u00fee mid ealle moda on Crist getreowe\u00f0, \u00feeh he manega synnen swelte, on his geleafe he \u00deiss he cw\u00e6\u00f0 beo \u00fe\u00e6re sawle dea\u00f0e, se \u00fee her cum\u00f0 \u00feurh \u00fea untrumnysse synne. God is swy\u00f0e mildheort, & he is geare, to \u00fean \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feurh his mildheortnysse h\u00e6le \u00fea \u00fe",
